OL,3,GNEWSA'I was terrified to talk about my
OL,4,Adaughter': The garden breaking the baby
OL,5,Aloss taboo
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor a long time, Emily Kinber found it
OL,8,Fdifficult to talk about her daughter
OL,9,FHallie, who died four hours after she
OL,10,Fwas born.
OL,12,FNow, she says a memorial garden created
OL,13,Fby bereaved parents has given her the
OL,14,Fconfidence to share her story.
OL,16,F"I was absolutely terrified at first to
OL,17,Fbe able to speak about Hallie, but
OL,18,Fsince joining the Pickering Foundation
OL,19,Fwe've become one big community and it's
OL,20,Fso positive," she said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
